title: M-x skg-strip-attribution
pid: 52791aad-6925-4d39-8a6b-164616496406
body: |2-
  On a fork, asks the next save to remove its attribution: the record
  of the note it was forked from, which its herald shows as
  =⌂:<HOME/ORIGINAL>=. Writes the request =stripAttribution= in the
  headline's metadata (herald =request:strip attribution=); does not
  save. A note you mean as your own, an evergreen note say, need not
  keep one; a reply in a dialog should. See =docs/forks.org=,
  "Attribution".
